{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_17207290","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728001:":{"text":"돈 없으면 다음에 다시 와!","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38E789132DA7031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728002:":{"text":"이렇게 무례할 수가!","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836882FB8D379B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728003:":{"text":"멋져요!","source_cn":"真好听！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91F87BB0DFC198D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728004:":{"text":"박수, 박수!","source_cn":"鼓掌鼓掌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81668F2F8DC2B6A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728005:":{"text":"멋있네요!","source_cn":"太精彩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D07C42A84C2947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1720728006:":{"text":"공연 고마워요!","source_cn":"谢谢你的表演！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4AA60ADEAE66043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720729001:0":{"text":"음유시인인가요? 저 사람도 배가 고픈 건 아니겠죠? 도와줘야 할까요?","source_cn":"那是个吟游诗人吧？他是不是也饿着肚子？我们能不能帮帮他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B8655F1A15165F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720729002:0":{"text":"페... 페... 잠시만요. 도와주는 것도 방법이 중요해요. 어른의 자존심은 배고픔보다 더 중요한 법이니까요.","source_cn":"佩……佩小姐，等等。帮忙也得讲究方法，成年人的自尊心，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9F9A765AEBC6772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720729003:0":{"text":"저도 알아요! 아주 예의 바르게 도와줄 거니까, 잘 보고 있으라고요!","source_cn":"我知道！我会很礼貌地提供帮助的。看我的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D76B50C6AEABCB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720729004:0":{"text":"페기는 숨을 깊게 들이마시고 앞으로 나섰다.","source_cn":"佩吉深吸了一口气，走上前去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF5E87358EEF427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720729005:0":{"text":"이렇게 무례할 수가! 좋은 술에는 돈이 아니라 음악과 시가 어울리는 법인데!","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！美酒应当搭配音乐和诗歌，而不是铜臭味！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x201AFCC5EBFCBB27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720729006:0":{"text":"음유시인님, 잠시만요.","source_cn":"这位先生，请留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB22DE23DB93937A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720729007:0":{"text":"전 당신의 재능이 정말 대단하다고 생각해요. 괜찮으시다면 제가 술값을 대신 내고 싶어요. 음... 예술을 위해서요.","source_cn":"我、我很欣赏您的才华，如果您不介意的话，我想替您支付酒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5049BBD7D69B49D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720729008:0":{"text":"돈을 대신 내준다고요? 예술을 위해서?","source_cn":"替我付钱？为了艺术？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC57F417164CD630C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720729009:0":{"text":"아가씨, 예의는 흠잡을 데 없이 훌륭하시군요. 하지만 그 생각은 예술을 위해서가 아닌, 그저 동정심에서 비롯된 것 같군요.","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的礼仪无可挑剔，但我听得出来，你的举动只不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24BB5CEAD27720E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720729010:0":{"text":"네? 하지만 저는...","source_cn":"哎？我……我没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBA37C20F2B95AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720729011:0":{"text":"호의는 감사합니다만, 괜찮습니다. 아무리 그럴듯하게 포장했어도 그런 동정은 받고 싶지 않군요.","source_cn":"收起你的好意吧。我的才华不需要施舍，哪怕是包装得再精美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF584F26A8F2666FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720729012:0":{"text":"방금 하신 말씀이 진짜라면 조용히 서서 노래를 끝까지 들어주시죠.","source_cn":"如果你真的欣赏我的才华，就该安静地站在这里，听我唱完这首歌。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED1582DF1CD46CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720729013:0":{"text":"제 노래에 감동을 받았다면, 그때 그 빌어먹을 골드를 던져 주시기 바랍니다. 물론, 아무 감흥이 없다면 그냥 가시고요.","source_cn":"要是我的歌声打动了你，我很欢迎你把那枚该死的金币放进我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x900C4204C3EF7996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720729014:0":{"text":"이게 음유시인이 마땅히 지켜야 할 자존심입니다. 지금처럼 노래를 시작하기도 전에, 적선하듯 돈 몇 푼 쥐여주는 것이 아니고요.","source_cn":"那才是一个吟游诗人应得的尊严，而不是像现在这样，还没开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x994E288FC07F4EE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720729015:0":{"text":"죄, 죄송해요. 저는 그냥 돕고 싶어서...","source_cn":"对……对不起。我只是想帮忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A994FECBD2B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720729016:0":{"text":"도와주고 싶다고요? 그럼 똑똑히 들으세요. 지금 사바나 최고의 음유시인이 당신을 위해 노래하고 있으니까!","source_cn":"想帮忙？那就竖起耳朵认真听吧。这可是全赛凡纳最好的吟游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29C189A43318F576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728001:":{"text":"돈 없으면 다음에 다시 와!","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38E789132DA7031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728002:":{"text":"이렇게 무례할 수가!","source_cn":"粗鲁！真是粗鲁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x836882FB8D379B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728003:":{"text":"멋져요!","source_cn":"真好听！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD91F87BB0DFC198D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728004:":{"text":"박수, 박수!","source_cn":"鼓掌鼓掌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81668F2F8DC2B6A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728005:":{"text":"멋있네요!","source_cn":"太精彩了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D07C42A84C2947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:25:1720728006:":{"text":"공연 고마워요!","source_cn":"谢谢你的表演！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4AA60ADEAE66043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1720729017:0":{"text":"...머나먼 마을에서 출발해 낡은 악기 하나를 노 삼아 길을 떠난 그는...","source_cn":"……他从千里之外的村庄启程，一把旧琴是他的舟桨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E6FC4C0F03DEFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1720729018:0":{"text":"...화려한 수도에 도착해 그곳이 꿈꾸던 고향이라 여겼지...","source_cn":"……他来到了纸醉金迷的王都，以为这里是梦中的故乡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44029EFDA77AB8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1720729019:0":{"text":"...사람들은 물 흐르듯 바쁘게 지나갈 뿐, 노래를 들으려 멈추지 않아...","source_cn":"……人群流水般匆匆经过，没有人驻足听他歌唱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31F7E1FC25E7C683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1720729020:0":{"text":"...사람들은 물결처럼 멀리 흘러가고, 귀를 기울이는 것은 바람과 새들뿐...","source_cn":"……人群流水般迢迢路过，风和鸟儿在听他唱歌……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEBD20DAB66B639B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1720729021:0":{"text":"...부드럽게 머무는 바람, 그를 위해 노래하는 새들...","source_cn":"……风儿为他温柔地停留，鸟儿为了他鸣鸣啾啾……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x954E30D23C2BA225","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1720729022:0":{"text":"...젊은 음유시인이여, 슬퍼하지 마라. 현이 끊어지지 않는 한...","source_cn":"……年轻的吟游诗人啊，不要忧伤，只要琴弦未断……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCBB41F7D3B80B8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1720729023:0":{"text":"...자유롭게 떠도는 삶을 즐기기를...","source_cn":"……就暂且享受这自由的流浪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7BBD4001EC137E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:34:1720729024:0":{"text":"노래가 끝난 뒤...","source_cn":"一曲表演结束后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BE153D793083F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:37:1720728001:":{"text":"돈 없으면 다음에 다시 와!","source_cn":"没钱就下次再来吧","status":"matched","hash_